// SOURCE: examples/voltty/core/main.vl
// The terminal state headless: SGR colours (named, 256, RGB), a wide
// character that does not fit and wraps, a combining mark, a title, a DSR
// reply, a line into the scrollback.
// ARGS: --escaped --dump 3 12 10
// STDIN: abc\e[1;31mred\e[38;5;208mor\e[48;2;1;2;3mrgb\e[0m\r\n
// STDIN: 0123456789\xe4\xb8\xad e\xcc\x81\e]2;voltty\x07\e[6n\r\nlast\n
// EXPECT: size 3 12
// EXPECT: cursor 2 4 0
// EXPECT: style block 0
// EXPECT: mode 28081
// EXPECT: title voltty
// EXPECT: tmpl n256 n257 0 - -
// EXPECT: charsets aaaa
// EXPECT: saved 0 0 0 n256 n257 0 - - aaaa
// EXPECT: reply \x1b[3;3R
// EXPECT: history 3
// EXPECT: row -3 abcredorrgb
// EXPECT: attr -3 3-5 n1 n257 2 - -
// EXPECT: attr -3 6-7 i208 n257 2 - -
// EXPECT: attr -3 8-10 i208 #010203 2 - -
// EXPECT: row -2 
// EXPECT: row -1 0123456789中 
// EXPECT: attr -1 10-10 n256 n257 20 - -
// EXPECT: attr -1 11-11 n256 n257 50 - -
// EXPECT: row 0  e\+{301}
// EXPECT: row 1 last
// EXPECT: row 2 
// EXPECT: end
